PolyCore includes Polykrom's former crates/kernel and crates/geom (now crates/polycore and
crates/polycore-geom), their tests and the kernel regression corpus from Polykrom (https://github.com/WCKDai/polykrom) and its upstream SolidCraft project
(https://github.com/tangency-labs/solidcraft). That work is licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0 and is
included here under the Apache License, Version 2.0 option. Its history and contributors'
copyright are retained. The Phase 0 source revision is recorded in polykrom.rev.

The kernel builds on Truck (https://github.com/ricosjp/truck), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. The vendored packages under vendor/ retain their original licence and copyright,
including Copyright (c) RICOS Co. Ltd. Local SolidCraft and Polykrom modifications are listed in
vendor/README.md and marked in the source. matext4cgmath is likewise used under Apache-2.0.

The STEP fixtures under tests/step-conformance, and their named copies in the kernel regression
corpus, were generated from formulas by the step-conformance contributors
(https://github.com/dan335/step-conformance, corpus/generated, commit 96f30bb) and are dedicated
to the public domain under CC0 1.0. See tests/step-conformance/README.md.

